  "name": "Chicken and Mushroom Soup",
  "subtitle": "A creamy soup with tender chicken, mushrooms, and vegetables.",
  "description": "Sautéed aromatics, chicken, vegetables, and mushrooms simmer in seasoned broth before being finished with cream and green onions.",
